<article class="env-lemma" id="0242">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0242">Lemma <span data-tag="0242">35.35.5</span>.</a> Let $X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $f : X \to X$ be a selfmap of $X$ over $S$. In this case pullback by $f$ is isomorphic to the identity functor on the category of descent data relative to $X \to S$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from Lemma <a href="/tag/023Y" data-tag="023Y">35.34.6</a> since it tells us that $f^* \cong \text{id}^*$. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>